      "status": "dnu",
      "dnu_reason": "prefile-ein",
      "note": "No .docx. It is the IRS's own fillable PDF plus a field map, and would have to be filed on the IRS form rather than retyped. Needed only if General Legal resumes obtaining the shelf entity's EIN before handoff."
